<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>velvet</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">sace6, jxdn</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">velvet</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">729zO7DaoSJMOLSvOh7UNN</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.204" end="00:21.850">Can't look away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.850" end="00:23.490">And I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.490" end="00:24.993">And I won't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.993" end="00:28.856">Help but think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.856" end="00:32.224">That you're not there when I need you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.224" end="00:34.446">And I need you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.446" end="00:41.647">I hate that I can't help it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.647" end="00:46.581">But I'm in love with velvet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.581" end="00:50.792">I'm in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.792" end="00:57.657">I don't think that I have the patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.657" end="00:59.921">There's something in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.921" end="01:02.478">It keeps me waiting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.478" end="01:04.434">I hate it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.434" end="01:06.025">That you're not there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.025" end="01:07.822">When I need you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.822" end="01:11.367">And I need you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.367" end="01:13.101">And it's not fair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.101" end="01:14.922">That your right here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.922" end="01:19.200">And I need you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.200" end="01:27.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.080" end="01:40.305">I swore I'd never touch this twice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.305" end="01:43.849">But all I ever do is lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.849" end="01:49.338">Anything to get this high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.338" end="01:54.562">I swore I'd never touch this twice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.562" end="01:58.063">But all I ever do is lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.063" end="02:01.645">Anything to get this high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.645" end="02:08.761">I hate that I can't help it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.761" end="02:13.536">But I'm in love with velvet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.536" end="02:15.810">I'm in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.810" end="02:22.927">I hate that I can't help it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.927" end="02:27.641">But I'm in love with velvet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.641" end="02:31.641">I'm in love</p></div></body></tt>